      <p class="ai-summary-text">
        <strong>Yes, Morocco is very safe to visit.</strong> Morocco is classified at <strong>Level 2: Exercise Increased Caution</strong> by the US Department of State and UK Foreign Office—the exact same safety tier given to France, the UK, and Italy. Violent crime targeting tourists is exceedingly rare. Dedicated Tourist Police (<em>Brigade Touristique</em>) are stationed across all historic medinas, and over 14 million international travelers visit each year without incident.
      </p>
